  "description": {
    "raw": "You enclose the target in a thin sheath of lead. This doesn’t restrict\nthe target’s movement or functionality, but protects it from the\neffects of radiation and prevents the penetration of many divination\nspells. The lead doesn’t coat the target’s equipment.",
